spike-turbovla
Derived from TurboVLA: https://github.com/H-EmbodVis/TurboVLA

The model, training and evaluation integration has been modified for SDT-V3
vision, frozen SmoothSpike text, text-interface calibration, spike Cross-attention,
and independent joint LIBERO training.

Original copyright notices and third-party license texts are retained.
